        "1.9",
        "E(X) = 1.9"
      ],
      "display_tex": "E(X) = 1.9",
      "input": "expression"
    },
    "hints": [
      "The mean is E(X) = Σ x P(X = x): multiply each value by its probability and add.",
      "The products are 0 × 0.1, 1 × 0.2, 2 × 0.4 and 3 × 0.3.",
      "0 + 0.2 + 0.8 + 0.9. Add them."
    ],
    "solution": [
      {
        "text": "Multiply each value by its probability and add.",
        "tex": "E(X) = 0(0.1) + 1(0.2) + 2(0.4) + 3(0.3)"
      },
      {
        "text": "Add.",
        "tex": "= 0 + 0.2 + 0.8 + 0.9 = 1.9"
      }
